From 1bc4931dd2380db37784967252838eaaf992b0f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NEESCHAL-3 <Nischalkhadka022@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 15:26:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] recovery: finalize rodin A/B preservation and Format Data
 fixes

Preserve the target ROM vendor_boot platform ramdisk while injecting only the OrangeFox recovery fragment.

Fix Virtual A/B Format Data ordering by unmapping recovery-created logical partitions before SnapshotManager handles the pending update.

Remove the stale metadata-encrypted userdata device-mapper target through libdm before formatting the physical userdata partition.

Also include APEX loading, target-slot checksum, ramdisk manifest, and related rodin recovery runtime fixes.
---
